jedimaster-XVT game, build @XVT_VERSION@

This program is a modified version of OpenXvT and Aeron, two open-source
projects by Adrien Moulin (https://github.com/elyosh/OpenXvT and
https://github.com/elyosh/Aeron). It was built from jedimaster-XVT, which
began as a copy of OpenXvT up to commit 51dfbfb (1 October 2026) and of
Aeron up to commit af5370d (29 September 2026), and has changed both
since. It is not an OpenXvT or Aeron release. Where the code came from,
and where to report a problem:
  https://github.com/evanleeturner/jedimaster-XVT/blob/main/ATTRIBUTION.md

